{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/drawer_item

    The link of one row of the mobile drawer (theme_dimensions/drawer_nav, which draws the list item
    around it), built by theme_dimensions\local\drawernav. A row with children is a link to its
    sub-panel's anchor, which amd/src/drawer.js turns into a sliding panel; without the module the link
    still reaches the panel, drawn below the root. A row without children is the node's own link.

    The text and the address are printed raw, as Boost Union's and core's drawers print them: core's node
    text, the custom menu's escaped label, or Boost Union's smart menu markup, and addresses already in
    their escaped spelling. Every other value is printed escaped.

    Context variables required for this template (described without braces, because a Mustache comment
    closes at the first pair of closing braces it meets):

    * text - The node's label, HTML
    * url - The node's address, escaped spelling
    * icon - The Font Awesome classes of the leading glyph, empty for none
    * iscurrent - Whether the row is the page being shown
    * haschildren - Whether the row opens a sub-panel
    * panelid - The id of that sub-panel, empty without children
    * tooltip - The node's tooltip, empty for none
    * attributes - The link attributes kept, each with name and value

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "My courses",
        "url": "https://example.com/my/courses.php",
        "icon": "fa fa-graduation-cap",
        "iscurrent": true,
        "haschildren": false,
        "panelid": "",
        "tooltip": "",
        "attributes": [
            {
                "name": "target",
                "value": "_self"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#haschildren}}
<a class="dimensions-drawer-item" href="#{{panelid}}" data-action="dimensions-drawer-open" data-target="{{panelid}}"{{#tooltip}} title="{{.}}"{{/tooltip}}>
    {{#icon}}<i class="icon {{icon}} fa-fw dimensions-drawer-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{/icon}}
    <span class="dimensions-drawer-text">{{{text}}}</span>
    <i class="icon fa fa-chevron-right fa-fw dimensions-drawer-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</a>
{{/haschildren}}
{{^haschildren}}
<a class="dimensions-drawer-item{{#iscurrent}} is-current{{/iscurrent}}" href="{{{url}}}"{{#iscurrent}} aria-current="page"{{/iscurrent}}{{#tooltip}} title="{{.}}"{{/tooltip}}{{#attributes}} {{name}}="{{value}}"{{/attributes}}>
    {{#icon}}<i class="icon {{icon}} fa-fw dimensions-drawer-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{/icon}}
    <span class="dimensions-drawer-text">{{{text}}}</span>
</a>
{{/haschildren}}
